From: pelya <x.pelya.x@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 25 Aug 2014 01:49:35 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 0161/1053] WIP backup savegames to network

---
 src/fios_gui.cpp               |  3 ++-
 src/lang/english.txt           |  4 ++++
 src/settings_type.h            |  1 +
 src/table/gameopt_settings.ini | 10 ++++++++++
